Note on data. This licence covers the software in this repository, not the
data it retrieves. Financial facts are fetched at runtime from SEC EDGAR,
whose public filing content the SEC states is free to access and reuse
(https://www.sec.gov/os/webmaster-faq). No third-party market data is
redistributed by this project; see docs/03-data-sources.md for why Indian
exchange prices are absent entirely.
